icial model repository is owned by Tencent-Hunyuan. That organization links to hy.tencent.com. Use its actual brand image rather than an unrelated 3D icon.","image","projectMedia","创作者项目媒体","/GameMap/media/demos/hunyuan3d-2.webp","Official Tencent Hunyuan3D 2.0 generation results showing cartoon character assets on a pink background","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2#%EF%B8%8F-hunyuan3d-20","Tencent Hunyuan · Hunyuan3D 2.0","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","年份","2025","year","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[93],"dimensions","开发阶段",[167],"stages","资产与动画","主题",[171,172,173,174],"tags","Image-to-3D","Mesh","Textures","Blender","延伸阅读",[177,178,179],{"_54":184,"_26":185},{"_54":182,"_26":183},{"_54":180,"_26":181},"2.0 license","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2/blob/main/LICENSE","2.1 repository","https://github.com/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hunyuan3D-2.1","2.0 paper","https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.12202","项目源码",[188],{"_54":186,"_26":141},"用途与特点","2.0 流程用 Hunyuan3D-DiT 生成形状，再用 Hunyuan3D-Paint 生成网格纹理，支持 GLB、OBJ 导出和 Blender 插件，采用腾讯混元 3D 2.0 专用社区许可。独立的 2.1 版本增加 PBR 纹理流程和训练代码。拓扑、LOD、绑定、碰撞、运行性能及各版本条款仍需按游戏流程核查。","detail","资源类型","工具","分类","3D 开发","category","summary","name","tool",[205,206,207],[171,172,173,174],[110],[111],2025,{"_54":184,"_26":185},{"_54":182,"_26":183},{"_54":180,"_26":181},{"_209":210},"documents",{"_63":211,"_36":212},[214,218,219,220,217,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238,239,240,241,242,243,244,245,246,247,248,249,250,251,252,216,253,215,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274],[213,214,215,216,217],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-cas